     "content": "Usa la imagen que envio de las referencias para crear 9:16 Create a photorealistic romantic portrait of a couple celebrating Sant Jordi (Saint George's Day) on La Rambla in Barcelona. \n\nThe scene shows an intimate moment during golden hour where a man and woman stand close together, nearly forehead to forehead, sharing a tender gaze. The man gently offers a vibrant red rose with his right hand while his left hand rests on her waist. He has a warm, genuine smile and looks at her with pure adoration.\n\nThe woman holds an antique leather-bound book close to her chest with both hands. She wears delicate gold jewelry featuring the traditional Catalan \"Dau de la Sort\" pendant. Her expression is radiant and joyful with a hint of playful shyness, her eyes sparkling with love as she looks back at him.\n\nThe background shows the iconic La Rambla boulevard with its plane trees, book stalls selling Catalan literature, and rose vendors. Gothic Quarter architecture and subtle Gaudí-inspired trencadís mosaic patterns are visible. Rose petals are scattered on the cobblestone street. The warm Mediterranean golden hour sunlight creates a romantic amber glow with soft backlight creating a halo effect around their hair.\n\nThe composition is a medium shot portrait with shallow depth of field, keeping the couple in sharp focus while the background has creamy bokeh. The image captures the essence of April 23rd in Catalonia, celebrating love, literature, and Catalan culture.",
