    "role": "user",
    "content": "Si el objetivo es que un generador que sí priorice las imágenes de referencia extraiga al máximo la identidad de ambos, yo escribiría el prompt así, dejando muy claro que las referencias tienen prioridad absoluta sobre la descripción.\n\n\n---\n\nPROMPT\n\nUse all three reference images as the primary source of identity. The facial structure, phenotype, proportions, eye shape, eyebrows, nose, lips, jawline, ears, hairline, hairstyle, skin tone, facial asymmetries and overall appearance of both people must match the references as closely as possible. Preserve their identity above everything else. Do not reinterpret, beautify, average, idealize or replace their facial features. They must be immediately recognizable as the exact same individuals shown in the references.\n\nCreate an ultra-photorealistic cinematic portrait of the same couple celebrating Sant Jordi (Saint George's Day) on La Rambla, Barcelona during golden hour.\n\nMedium shot, horizontal composition.\n\nThe couple stands very close together, almost forehead to forehead, smiling naturally while looking into each other's eyes.\n\nThe man gently offers a single vibrant red rose with his right hand while his left hand rests softly on her waist.\n\nThe woman holds an antique leather-bound book against her chest with both hands and wears delicate gold jewelry featuring the traditional Catalan Dau de la Sort pendant.\n\nBackground: authentic La Rambla with plane trees, Sant Jordi book stalls, rose vendors, Catalan books, Gothic Quarter architecture, subtle Gaudí-inspired trencadís details, scattered rose petals on the pavement and warm Mediterranean spring atmosphere.\n\nLighting: cinematic golden hour, soft amber sunlight, gentle backlight creating a subtle halo around their hair, natural skin tones, high dynamic range.\n\nCamera: full-frame 85 mm portrait lens, f/1.8, shallow depth of field, creamy bokeh, ultra-high facial detail, realistic skin texture, natural imperfections, true photographic realism.\n\nPriority order:\n\n1. Exact identity and phenotype from the reference photos.\n\n\n2. Facial proportions must remain unchanged.\n\n\n3. Preserve both hairstyles and natural expressions.\n\n\n4. Photorealism.\n\n\n5. Sant Jordi environment and atmosphere.\n\n\n\nDo not redesign the faces, merge identities, beautify them, make them look like models, alter age, change ethnicity, change facial proportions, or generate generic attractive faces. The final image must look like a real photograph of the exact same couple in the reference images, simply placed in this Sant Jordi scene.\n\n\n---\n\nEse es el tipo de prompt que más insiste en que la identidad facial sea el objetivo principal. Aun así, el resultado final también depende de la capacidad del generador de imágenes y de cómo maneje las fotos de referencia.",
